          "ok": true,
          "pos": 193
        },
        {
          "text": "“You don’t need to apologize to me.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 231
        },
        {
          "text": "I looked toward the mirror. My reflection stared back. Twenty-five. Blonde hair tied loosely behind my head. Not twenty.",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 424
        },
        {
          "text": "Sometimes memories forget to respect time",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 589
        }
      ],
      "words": 75
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“This place makes me remember every hard moment,” I admitted softly. Hannah nodded and didn’t ask which memory I referre",
