          "pos": 632
        },
        {
          "text": "Learning to walk again",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 810
        },
        {
          "text": "The first wound dressing",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 834
        },
        {
          "text": "The horror of seeing the scar uncovered for the first time",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 860
        },
        {
          "text": "My first prosthetic fitting",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 920
        },
        {
          "text": "The first time someone told me I might ride again, and I wanted to punch them because might felt more insulting than nev",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 949
        }
      ],
      "words": 81
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Yes.” I nodded, and this time she believed me enough to continue",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1125
        },
        {
          "text": "Five years ago, I’d needed both hands wrapped around these bars just to move six feet",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1489
        },
        {
          "text": "Today I walked without touching them",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1575
        }
      ],
      "words": 36
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I watched my shoulders then my hips and my stride, and saw exactly what Beau kept noticing",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1812
        },
        {
          "text": "You’ve been limping for twenty minutes",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1904
        },
        {
          "text": "The thought came before I could stop it",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1943
        },
        {
          "text": "My chest tightened",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1984
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nothing.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2045
        },
        {
          "text": "She waited. I hated everyone who had learned that trick. “Someone noticed that I don’t walk normally.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2054
        }
      ],
      "words": 57
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“That isn’t catastrophic.” She knew that I liked to keep my prosthetic hidden, we’d spoken about it at length, and she’d",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2175
        },
        {
          "text": "I looked at her. “He doesn’t know about my leg.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2442
        },
        {
          "text": "Understanding changed her expression. “Is he important?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2488
        },
        {
          "text": "“I didn’t want him to be, but he’s creeping into my heart.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2543
        }
      ],
      "words": 70
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“I’ve known him for like two weeks.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2651
        },
        {
          "text": "“We went on one date.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2691
        },
        {
          "text": "I walked again. The irritated skin made me shorten my stride unconsciously, and I corrected it. “He’s going to know even",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2854
        }
      ],
      "words": 43
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“What if—” The rest sat behind my teeth",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3093
        },
        {
          "text": "What if his face changed",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3132
        },
        {
          "text": "What if the way he touched my waist disappeared",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3158
        },
        {
          "text": "What if concern replaced attraction",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3207
        },
        {
          "text": "What if he became careful",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3244
        },
        {
          "text": "What if he looked at Hunter like a brother because Hunter was a man and looked at me like someone whose body no longer f",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3271
        }
      ],
      "words": 66
    },
    {
      "block": "原句8",
      "no": 8,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "That was the strange thing about something that had once felt like the end of the world. Eventually it became maintenanc",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3776
        },
        {
          "text": "I just wasn’t sure I believed someone could love it as casually as I had learned to live with it",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4420
        }
      ],
      "words": 61
    },
    {
      "block": "原句9",
      "no": 9,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "How’s your day",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4924
        },
        {
          "text": "Productive",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5179
        },
        {
          "text": "Sounds suspicious",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5221
        },
        {
          "text": "That’s what you say when your day sucked but you don’t want to complain",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5257
        },
        {
          "text": "I stared at the message. Damn him",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5328
        },
        {
          "text": "You think you know me already",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5370
        },
        {
          "text": "Starting to",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5406
        }
      ],
      "words": 41
    },
    {
      "block": "原句10",
      "no": 10,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Truck should be ready tomorrow btw",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5531
        },
        {
          "text": "Seriously",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5603
        },
        {
          "text": "Took her out this morning. Runs good",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5654
        },
        {
          "text": "Still sounds like an old man coughing when she starts but apparently that’s “character.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5692
        },
        {
          "text": "I laughed again. Pops would’ve liked him. That thought came so easily it almost hurt",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5778
        },
        {
          "text": "I know",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2426
        },
        {
          "text": "Your interview",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5943
        }
      ],
      "words": 53
    },
    {
      "block": "原句11",
      "no": 11,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He let me keep what I wasn’t ready to give. That affected me more than if he’d asked. I got in the Camry and rested my h",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6828
        },
        {
          "text": "Maybe it was smaller",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7153
        },
        {
          "text": "A question not pushed",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7175
        },
        {
          "text": "A limp noticed but not overanalyzed",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7198
        },
        {
          "text": "A joke arriving on exactly the wrong morning and somehow making it better",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7235
        },
        {
          "text": "I wasn’t ready to tell Beau Jones about my leg today",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7310
        },
        {
          "text": "But maybe I would be soon",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7363
        }
      ],
